{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">上合組織峰會在吉爾吉斯舉行，國家主席習近平到達會場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_LIVE XI.ARRIVE.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20261UIz8l0amv1788235975.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_LIVE XI.ARRIVE.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">吉爾吉斯總統扎帕羅夫在場迎接習近平，兩人一齊合照。今年是上合組織成立25周年，成員包括中國、俄羅斯，印度、巴基斯坦、伊朗，還有四個中亞國家，以及白俄羅斯。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T04:20:02.362233+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}